  "abi": "i64_array_bytes_output",
  "description": "Point updates to vertex values or undirected-edge affine maps, followed by an arbitrary-root sum of path-composed vertex values using a maintained rake/compress top-tree hierarchy.",
  "source": {
    "repository": "yosupo06/library-checker-problems",
